        "html": "<p>The system extracts hundreds of fields automatically, including:</p>\n<h3>Material Information</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Material grade</li>\n<li>Specification</li>\n<li>Standard</li>\n<li>Product type</li>\n<li>Thickness</li>\n<li>Width</li>\n<li>Length</li>\n<li>Weight</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Traceability Information</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Heat number</li>\n<li>Cast number</li>\n<li>Batch number</li>\n<li>Coil number</li>\n<li>Plate number</li>\n<li>Lot number</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Chemical Composition</h3>\n<p>Examples include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Carbon</li>\n<li>Manganese</li>\n<li>Silicon</li>\n<li>Chromium</li>\n<li>Nickel</li>\n<li>Molybdenum</li>\n<li>Phosphorus</li>\n<li>Sulfur</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Mechanical Properties</h3>\n<p>Examples include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Yield Strength</li>\n<li>Tensile Strength</li>\n<li>Elongation</li>\n<li>Hardness</li>\n<li>Impact Test</li>\n<li>Reduction of Area</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Commercial Information</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Purchase Order</li>\n<li>Sales Order</li>\n<li>Customer</li>\n<li>Mill</li>\n<li>Shipment Number</li>\n<li>Certificate Number</li>\n</ul>"
