        "html": "<p>One of the most valuable outcomes is instant certificate retrieval.</p>\n<p>Users can search by:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Heat number</li>\n<li>Customer</li>\n<li>Material grade</li>\n<li>Purchase Order</li>\n<li>Certificate number</li>\n<li>Batch number</li>\n<li>Date range</li>\n</ul>\n<p>What once took hours can be completed in seconds.</p>"
